	<div class="col-md-12 order-first">
		<p>
			In the beginning, Graco made four different versions of the TrueCoat airless paint sprayer. These were the TrueCoat, TrueCoat Pro, TrueCoat Plus and TrueCoat Fine  Finish. These sprayers vary on power source, lifespan, and pressure rating. This chart is available to help you see the side by side differences.
		</p>
